his is the folder containing the `CMakeLists.txt` and source code for `llama.cpp`.\n*   **`-B \"${srcdir}/build\"`**: Specifies the **build directory**. CMake will generate intermediate files (like `.ninja` files) here, keeping the source tree clean"}